            </div>
            <div>
              <h4 class="font-medium text-white text-sm">Fix Bug</h4>
              <p class="text-gray-300 mt-1 text-sm">Beberapa bug yang sering ditemui di versi sebelumnya sudah di fix pada SimaStream v2 ini, salah satunya bug streaming tiba-tiba terhenti.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
<style>
  #server-clock, #mobile-server-clock {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
  @media (min-width: 550px) {
    #mobile-server-time {
      display: flex !important;
    }
    #mobile-separator {
      display: block !important;
    }
  }
  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    #mobile-server-time {
      display: none !important;
    }
    #mobile-separator {
      display: none !important;
    }
  }
  #profile-dropdown {
    position: fixed;
    z-index: 100;
    min-width: 220px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
    pointer-events: auto;
